# Content & SEO

## Page metadata

- Unique `title` and `description` per page via Next.js `metadata` export.
- Homepage title pattern: `Tax & GST Consultants in Kolkata | TaxSimpl Advisors LLP`
- Service pages: `[Service Name] in Kolkata | TaxSimpl`

## Copy tone

- Professional, reassuring, concise — written for business owners and individuals, not accountants.
- Lead with **what the visitor gets**, then process, then CTA.
- Use Indian English and INR/₹ where pricing is shown.

## Service page template

Each service page should include:

1. One-sentence summary (who it's for)
2. What's included / timeline
3. Documents required (checklist)
4. FAQ (3–5 questions)
5. Related services + contact CTA

## SEO & structured data

- Add `LocalBusiness` / `ProfessionalService` JSON-LD on contact and homepage.
- Use descriptive `alt` text on all images.
- Internal links from blog posts to relevant service pages.
- No duplicate meta descriptions across pages.

## Accessibility

- One `h1` per page; logical heading hierarchy.
- Form labels tied to inputs; error messages announced to screen readers.
- Do not disable viewport zoom (`user-scalable=no`).
